  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f9fc80ad488c9bcf49b/step-9855b700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add lentils and tomato & herb seasoning and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f9fc80ad488c9bcf49b/step-aef2f110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan, add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the brown sugar and water (for the red sauce), stirring occasionally, until thickened, 4-6 minutes.\n• Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f9fc80ad488c9bcf49b/step-81d71b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the lentils are cooking, in a small saucepan, heat the butter over medium heat.\n• Add the plain flour and cook, stirring until a thick paste forms, 1-2 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium-low, then slowly whisk in the milk and water (for the white sauce) until smooth. Simmer, stirring constantly, until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then stir in Parmesan cheese.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f9fc80ad488c9bcf49b/step-31e45230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spoon roughly 1/4 of the lentil filling into a baking dish, then top with a lasagne sheet. Repeat with remaining filling and lasagne sheets.\n• Finish with a final lasagne sheet, then pour over the white sauce.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Bake lasagne, until golden, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f9fc80ad488c9bcf49b/step-2a5d2f40.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide herby tomato and lentil bolognese lasagne between bowls to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f9fc80ad488c9bcf49b/step-2db56550.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
